OL,3,GNEWSAWoman died after three-year ADHD
OL,4,Aassessment wait
OL,5,
OL,6,FA coroner says there is a "significant
OL,7,Frisk of future deaths" unless delays
OL,8,Fwithin ADHD services are fixed, after a
OL,9,Fwoman took her own life while waiting
OL,10,Ffor a diagnostic assessment.
OL,12,FBethany Hewitt was found dead in her
OL,13,Fhome in Runcorn, Cheshire, on 22
OL,14,FFebruary, three years after being
OL,15,Freferred for an ADHD assessment in
OL,16,FFebruary 2023.
OL,18,FOn 3 February, she told a GP at Grove
OL,19,FHouse Medical Practice she had had
OL,20,Fsuicidal thoughts and was found dead 19
OL,21,Fdays later.
OL,23,APub: 18-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NW Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
FL,406,400,260,160,0,100
